{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30113","headline":"赠敬晊助教二首 二 · 刘得仁","name":"赠敬晊助教二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"街西静观求居处，不到权门到寺频。\n禁掖人知连状荐，国庠官满一家贫。\n清仪称是蓬瀛客，直气堪爲谏诤臣。\n自顾无成年渐长，报恩惟愿杀微身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}